{"created": "2025-06-03T10:57:58.018918+00:00", "modified": "2025-06-03T10:57:58.306222+00:00", "id": 15407849, "conceptrecid": "15407848", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15407849", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.15407848", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15407849", "metadata": {"title": "INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Lithium-Ion Battery Cell Characterization Data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15407849", "publication_date": "2025-05-14", "description": "<h1>Scope</h1>\n<p>This collection contains records related to laboratory characterization of INR18650-MJ1 cells manufactured by LG Chem. The records contain <strong>(i) the raw data provided by laboratory personnel</strong> and <strong>(ii) model parameters obtained from processing this raw data</strong>. The data contained in these records is intended to support model parameterization for INR18650-MJ1 cells and could also be relevant for other Li-ion batteries using NMC, Graphite, and Silicon Oxide as active materials.</p>\n<h1>Contents</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Direct Characterization Data</a></td>\n<td>Data obtained from laboratory characterization of MJ1 cells using electrochemical techniques, SEM, and EDX.</td>\n<td>Used for parameterization of MJ1 models.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15496570\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Complete Continuum Simulation Parameters</a></td>\n<td>Complete parameterization in Python class format based on the raw data from record <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193\">18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Direct Characterization Data</a> and the data pipelines collected in <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15518714\">18650-LG-3500-MJ1-Anode</a> and 18650-LG-3500-MJ1-Cathode.</td>\n<td>Used to instantiate MJ1 digital twin.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Associated Records</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Relationship</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://schema.org/hasPart\">hasPart</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15518714\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Anode</a></td>\n<td>Data pipeline for thorough analysis and review of GITT and EIS measurements for diffusivity characteriztion of the graphite-silicon-oxide electrode.</td>\n<td>Digital twin-suitable determination of diffusivity and comparison of SPM, SPMe, and DFN continuum model parameterizations.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://schema.org/hasPart\">hasPart</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537477\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode</a></td>\n<td>All data obtained on the harvested cathode of the MJ1 cylindrical 18650 cell from LG CHEM</td>\n<td>Parameterization of models for the NMC-based cathode</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Licensing</h1>\n<p>See the individual records for licensing information</p>\n<h1>Contact Information</h1>\n<p>For questions or further assistance, please contact Dennis Kopljar at dennis.kopljar@dlr.de.</p>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<p>This dataset is linked to the following publication: [DOI/Link to publication].</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kuhn, Yannick", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0002-9019-2290"}, {"name": "Rana, Bhawna", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0001-6403-5139"}, {"name": "Philipp, Micha", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0009-0002-8705-2059"}, {"name": "Schmitt, Christina", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-4095-7611"}, {"name": "Scipioni, Roberto", "affiliation": "SINTEF Energy Research", "orcid": "0000-0003-1926-421X"}, {"name": "Flores, Eibar", "affiliation": "SINTEF Industry", "orcid": "0000-0003-2954-1233"}, {"name": "Kopljar, Dennis", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-2228-2016"}, {"name": "Clark, Simon", "affiliation": 